        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Branford, Connecticut; Long Island Sound; New Haven County; New Haven; Bronx County; New York City; Westchester County; Connecticut; Long Island; Block Island Sound; East River\n- Concepts: shoreline towns; tidal estuaries; Atlantic Ocean\n\nFacts:\n- Long Island Sound is a tidal estuary of the Atlantic Ocean.\n- Long Island Sound lies between the eastern shores of Bronx County in New York City, southern Westchester County, and Connecticut to the north, and the North Shore of Long Island to the south.\n- Long Island Sound stretches 110 miles from the East River in New York City along the North Shore of Long Island to Block Island Sound.\n- Branford is a shoreline town in New Haven County, Connecticut, on Long Island Sound, 8 miles east of New Haven.",
